<h3 class=3D"text-lg font-bold text-text-100 mt-1 -mb-1.5"><strong>=F0=9F=
=94=AC 2. Image Lazy Loading - THE PERFORMANCE OPTIMIZER</strong></h3>
<h4 class=3D"text-base font-bold text-text-100 mt-1"><strong>=F0=9F=8C=B1 N=
gu=E1=BB=93n G=E1=BB=91c &amp; Motivation</strong></h4>
<p class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Problem Statement Chi Ti=
=E1=BA=BFt:</strong></p>
<p class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words">Trong modern web applications, i=
mages often account cho 60-70% c=E1=BB=A7a total page weight. Traditional l=
oading approach l=C3=A0 load t=E1=BA=A5t c=E1=BA=A3 images immediately, cau=
sing:</p>
<ol class=3D"[&amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:p=
b-1 list-decimal space-y-1.5 pl-7">
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Bandwidth Waste</strong=
>: Loading images user never sees</li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Slow Initial Load</stro=
ng>: Large payload blocks critical rendering path</li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Poor UX</strong>: Users=
 wait for unnecessary resources</li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Mobile Performance</str=
ong>: Especially painful on slow connections</li>
</ol>
<p class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words">=F0=9F=92=AD <strong>Historical =
Context</strong>: <em>T=E1=BA=A1i Figma, ch=C3=BAng t=C3=B4i c=C3=B3 design=
 files v=E1=BB=9Bi hundreds of images. Without lazy loading, user experienc=
e would be catastrophic. Initial page load time dropped t=E1=BB=AB 12s xu=
=E1=BB=91ng 3s with proper lazy loading.</em></p>
<p class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Alternative Solutions &a=
mp; Trade-offs:</strong></p>
<ul class=3D"[&amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:p=
b-1 list-disc space-y-1.5 pl-7">
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Server-side rendering v=
=E1=BB=9Bi placeholder</strong>: Good for SEO, complex implementation</li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Progressive JPEG</stron=
g>: Smaller initial payload, limited browser support</li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>WebP with fallbacks</st=
rong>: Better compression, compatibility issues</li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Lazy loading</strong>: =
Best balance c=E1=BB=A7a performance v=C3=A0 implementation complexity</li>
</ul>
