ental Model</strong>: <em>When event loop behavior seems wrong, I check: 1)=
 Sync vs async boundaries, 2) Promise vs setTimeout timing, 3) Error handli=
ng breaking the loop, 4) Long-running tasks blocking, 5) Memory leaks trong=
 closures.</em></p>
<p class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Common Interview Questio=
ns:</strong></p>
<p class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Q: What's the difference=
 between microtasks v=C3=A0 macrotasks?</strong>
<strong>A</strong>:</p>
<ul class=3D"[&amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:p=
b-1 list-disc space-y-1.5 pl-7">
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Microtasks</strong>: Hi=
gher priority, processed completely before next macrotask (Promise.then, as=
ync/await)</li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Macrotasks</strong>: Lo=
wer priority, one per event loop cycle (setTimeout, DOM events)</li>
</ul>
