<h4 class=3D"text-base font-bold text-text-100 mt-1"><strong>=F0=9F=92=A1 I=
ntuitive Understanding</strong></h4>
<p class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Margin Collapse Analogy<=
/strong>:
Think of margins nh=C6=B0 <strong>personal space bubbles</strong>:</p>
<ul class=3D"[&amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:p=
b-1 list-disc space-y-1.5 pl-7">
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Two people standing clo=
se</strong>: Bubbles overlap, total space =3D larger bubble</li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Person near wall</stron=
g>: Bubble merges v=E1=BB=9Bi wall, no extra space</li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Barrier between people<=
/strong>: Bubbles can't merge, spaces add up</li>
</ul>
<p class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>BFC Analogy</strong>:
Think of BFC nh=C6=B0 <strong>separate rooms</strong>:</p>
<ul class=3D"[&amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:p=
b-1 list-disc space-y-1.5 pl-7">
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Same room</strong>: Fur=
niture (elements) interact, margins collapse</li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Different rooms</strong=
>: Furniture independent, no interaction</li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Room divider</strong>: =
Creates boundary, prevents interaction</li>
</ul>
